    narr:narration """Tanya's voice here is a chair converting deliberation into settled rules, now across four dated meetings. In the first she [bounds the meeting against a steering-group deadline](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_1), [states her landing position before hearing others](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_8), and [prices the cutovers as contained versus unbounded risk](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_13); she probes rather than accepts ([asking where a two-week figure comes from](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_18)), then [ratifies the reasoning on the record](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_20) and [orders the reporting constraint written as a rule, not guidance](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_31), adding a [political framing that keeps reference-data blame on the vendor](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_39) before [rehearsing her steering-group script](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_42). A week later she [briefs a newcomer on the settled shape](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_2), [restates the one-at-a-time rule](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_7), and — the notable move — [adopts someone else's sharper version of her own argument](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_13), [committing to lead with it](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_17). The same day, in a third meeting, she [clarifies what is and isn't changing](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_10), [redirects recovered time into a buffer](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_18), and [formally supersedes her own earlier note on the record](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20) — a register shift into formality — while [crediting the better argument she'd been given that morning](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_12) and [thanking the person for raising it rather than letting it ride](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_23). The newest meeting opens a genuinely fresh front: [a legal question nobody in the programme can answer](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_1) about [what happens to eleven years of closed history left on the old platform](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_3); she [adds her own reason for an obviously-closed archive](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_16), [insists the retention number come from legal in writing](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_20), [states the full position formally](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_22), and [admits she'd have got the sequencing wrong on her own](narr:Expr_5HalyardLegacyArchive20260922_25). The register stays casual-but-commanding, antithesis and parallelism dominant in her org lane, with consultation and legitimate authority run side by side.""" ;
